	quest.04AB969794B55A42.quest_desc: ["&6Dropped by Rimuru, Supermassive Slimes, and Luminous. &rConsuming it grants 10 minutes of accelerated skill learning. If you possess Great Sage, Sage, Wisdom King, or Fortune King: Fortuna, it also grants some mastery. With Fortune King: Fortuna, consuming 10 allows you to lock this Ultimate Skill in the “Lock” screen, preventing it from being lost upon reincarnation."]
