	quest.07D69899C52591E9.quest_desc: [
		"There are three stages. Each time the blood volume is reduced by one-third, you will enter the next stage."
		"&6The skills it possesses are fire attack negation, heat negation, abnormal status negation, body strengthening and steel power."
		""
		"The Blazing Frenzied Soul can be spawned in the Nether Fortress after defeating it."
	]
	quest.07D69899C52591E9.quest_subtitle: "Lord of Fire"
	quest.07D69899C52591E9.title: "Defeat the Flame Demon"
	quest.07E64C0B306DB76F.quest_desc: [
		"If you want to evolve into a Demon Lord, then you need to obtain 10,000 souls. Souls can be obtained by killing various creatures. The higher the EP of the creature, the more souls it has."
		""
		"&lEvolved characteristics&r"
		"Grant&43 times EP&raddition"
		"Ally attributes&bDouble&r"
		"Some NPC allies evolve"
		"all that apply&5Resistance Evolution&ris invalid"
		""
		"&6Friendly reminder: You can first obtain a large amount of EP and save it first, and then evolve into Demon Lord when you feel it is about the same, doubling the cost-effectiveness~&r"
		""
		"Before awakening, the player will experience a 3-minute&6“Harvest Festival”&rstage:"
		""
		"During the first minute, players cannot use any Skills, and their vision and movement abilities are limited; all follower units within the range will automatically switch to the \"Follow and Protect\" state."
		""
		"When entering the 2nd minute, the player will immediately enter \"sleep mode\"."
		""
		"In the last minute, the player's followers and monster followers within range will also automatically enter \"sleep mode\"."
		"As the ritual comes to an end, the sound and visual effects will gradually increase; in the final 10 seconds, the player will begin to blink and slowly lift into the air until the awakening is complete."
	]
	quest.07E64C0B306DB76F.quest_subtitle: "kill!"
