		"&6The Skills it possesses are: Cold Invalidation, Pain Invalidation, Holy Attack Resistance, Poison Invalidation, Abnormal Status Resistance and Psychic Attack Resistance"
	]
	quest.21B29DCE7B2F00E1.quest_subtitle: "Skeleton Dragon"
	quest.21B29DCE7B2F00E1.title: "Crusade against ancient relics"
	quest.21D64A9C2520E210.quest_desc: [
		"[ { \"text\": \"Click to view the quests you need to complete [Ancient Forest]\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4835EBAC6D933CDB\" } } ]"
		""
		"&6&lInternal introduction:&r"
		"After entering the maze, you are in a large corridor. Follow the corridor up to the battle platform of the \"Holy Spirit Guardian Colossus\"."
		"Once inside, you must defeat it or be defeated by it."
		"&8&lEnding - Death:&r"
		"-You won't actually die, you will be teleported outside the barrier (exit direction)."
		"-Elves can still be contracted."
		""
		"&6&lEnding - Victory:&r"
		"-When a Colossus dies, it drops a block of pure magicsteel."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"After defeating or being defeated by the Colossus, you can then proceed up the stairs that turn right and lead upward."
		"On platforms, hold down Shift to get the following levels of sprites:"
		"Prayer has a cooldown of 1200 seconds (or 20 minutes)."
		"&b1. Lower Elf (Level 1)&r"
		"-Low magic power."
		"-Only give players the corresponding lower magic and corresponding element control (needs to learn)."
		"&22. Median Elf (Level 2)&r"
		"-The magic power is higher than that of lower elves."
		"-Gives players the median magic of the corresponding element and the control of the corresponding element (requires learning)."
		"-You can use [Medium Elf Summon] to materialize the mid-elf you own (switching required)."
		"&53. Superior Elf (Level 3)&r"
		"-Close to the strongest elf species."
		"-Gives players all corresponding element magic and corresponding element control (needs to learn)."
		"-This type of spirit is necessary to awaken the \"brave\" (collect all 6 types)."
		"-You can use [Higher Spirit Summoning] to materialize the high-ranking spirit you own (switching required)."
		"&44. Elf King (Level 4)&r"
		"-The strongest elf type currently."
		"-It does not provide additional abilities, but it is extremely rare and the probability of obtaining it is extremely low."
		""
		"instruction:"
		"If you want to know what sprites/cooldowns etc you have you can use the command"
		"/tensura get spirit"
	]
	quest.21D64A9C2520E210.quest_subtitle: "Dimension where the elves are!"
