		"Racial ability: R key&b(Some races have abilities and some don’t)"
		"Release Skill: Z, X, C keys ALT+corresponding key can switch mode"
		"&6Note: Some Skills can switch to sub-mode using Shift+corresponding key"
		""
		"Dodge/Drop the mount: V key"
		"Biological naming: N key&b(Some creatures can be named, some cannot, and sufficient EP is required)"
		""
		"&6Other commonly used keys:"
		"Open backpack: H key&b(exquisite backpack)"
		"Open the big map: M key"
		"Chain chopping trees: Shift + crouch + left click to chop"
	]
