	quest.29D96A1CE4910C8B.quest_desc: "&6Dropped by Rimuru, Supermassive Slime, and Lumisdin. &rConsuming it grants 10 minutes of accelerated skill learning. If you have Great Sage, Sage, or King of Wisdom, it also increases some proficiency. If you have King of Wisdom, consuming 10 of these lets you lock this Ultimate Skill on the \"Lock\" screen, preventing it from being lost through reincarnation."
