	quest.34D8E3A129C8B3D9.quest_desc: [
		"&l\"Temporal Dawn\""
		"Long ago, time in the Overworld did not flow in a straight line."
		"In the old era, a group of clockmakers discovered a strange ore. Unlike iron and gold, it was not silent. It trembled softly in the night, as if hiding an invisible chime. The clockmakers called it Clockstone. They used Clockstone to build towers, engrave blueprints, and forge gears, attempting to open the gate at the end of time."
		""
		"..."
		""
		"But the first people who entered Temporal Dawn never returned. After they crossed through, the portal became one-way. The ancient clockmakers realized that what they had opened was not a treasure vault, but a prison sealed shut by time..."
	]
	quest.34D8E3A129C8B3D9.quest_subtitle: "Disordered space-time"
