	quest.3793BC9A3109DA3E.quest_desc: [
		"There seems to be a book that records this, which can be found in the Hippocratic Grass distributed around the world.&5And it is very sensitive to Magicule&r, so where the concentration of Magicule is higher, the chance of the seed appearing is greater?"
		""
		"How to use: place&2hippocut seed&rPlanted on grass blocks, dirt blocks, or farmland"
		"{image:tensura:item/hipokute_seeds width:20 height:20 align:center}"
		"&lRandom Growth Mechanics:&r"
		""
		"● In the normal world,&610% chance every 0.05 seconds&rThe seeds will grow into Hippocrates."
		""
		"● &6If planted in the underworld, the chance increases to 25%!&r"
		""
		"● The rest&690% probability&rWill turn into ordinary wheat and continue to grow in the same way as ordinary wheat (75% chance of becoming in the underworld)."
		"{image:tensura:item/hipokute_grass width:20 height:20 align:center}"
		"● When the plant reaches the \"grass\" stage, it will make a choice: Yes&650% probability&rbecome&2&lhippocut grass&r 。"
		""
		"{image:tensura:item/hipokute_flower width:20 height:20 align:center}"
	]
