	quest.381650201BD5521E.quest_desc: [
		"Possess a weakened physical body to enter a whole new world."
		"How to use:"
		"&lActive Skill&r If used while in a possession state, leaves the body (unless it is the original body, it will disappear after 5 minutes to avoid lag) and its inherent Skills, and transforms the player into spirit form. In spirit form, if the player can possess the target: [Ineffective against targets with psychic attack immunity]"
		""
		"&l- Non-player monsters: &r"
		"Health below 10%, spiritual health below 10%, or maximum EP less than 25% (relative to the user) - If the target has spiritual attack resistance, drops to 5% health, 5% spirit health, or 12.5% EP."
		""
		"&l- Player:&r Requires 2 of the 3 optional conditions above. If possessed, the target player enters spirit form, and without the [Possession] skill will eventually die."
		"When possessing the target, the user returns to physical form with the target's physical attributes and skills."
		""
		"&lWarning: When using this skill, held items and armor will remain on the old body.&r"
		""
		"&lFriendly reminder:&r Access your inventory and retrieve these items from the old body."
		"When switching bodies via 3010Possession3011, only status effects with the \"spiritual affected\" tag are transferred; other regular status effects will not be transferred with the soul."
	]
