	quest.3F92724DDA398BAB.quest_desc: [
		"&6You can't kill [Stern] directly; you have to trick the \"Judgment Bird\" into the immobilization trap during the round when [Crime of Murder] is pronounced, and then induce [Severe] to kill the bird with [Purification Laser], so that it can \"commit\" itself. Every time it \"commits\", the boss's health bar will be reduced by 1.&6It will die after 10 reductions."
		""
		""
		"Its real \"health bar\" is not its life, but how many times it can commit [crimes] severely. The initial value is 10. Every time it successfully commits a crime, its health bar is -1. When it commits ≥ 5 crimes in total, it enters the second stage."
		""
		"So this battle is not essentially an \"output war\", but:"
		"Design a game and let the boss break the rules himself."
		""
		"[Crime of Murder] is your output turn"
		"In this round, killing any entity will give the killer +1 [Crime]"
		"This is the only round that can make Yan Yan lose blood."
		"Because you can let it kill the Bird of Judgment"
		"Prioritize the bird of judgment, lead the bird to the immobilization trap, let the bird be tied up, and then wait/guide it strictly to fire the purification laser"
	]
