	quest.4205403C9223C4B7.quest_desc: [
		"As shown in the picture, after the player presses the B key to enter the personal Skill panel, he will see some gray Skills (except resistance Skills)."
		"At this time, just click on the Skill you want to use/learn, and then click on the Skill slot in the shortcut bar to store the Skill in the shortcut bar. The operation method is the same as when equipping the Skill to the shortcut bar."
		""
		"After the setting is completed, press the corresponding Skill keys Z, X, and C to \"learn\" the Skill."
		"After Skill learning is completed, the same keys will still be used when releasing the Skill later."
		"Some skills can switch modes using ALT + the corresponding Skill key and Shift + corresponding to the Skill key."
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/skill.png width:150 height:150 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.4205403C9223C4B7.quest_subtitle: "You won’t know it if you don’t look at it!"
	quest.42D4A8EEE5E25183.quest_desc: [
		"The teleportation stone platform allows players to freely teleport to the place where the teleportation stone is bound. They only need Shift+right-click to bind, and&5Use the magic \"Space Gate\"&rOpen the interface and select the portal icon."
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/portal.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		"If you want to delete the record, just click the exclamation mark and then quickly click the red icon button in the middle twice."
	]
	quest.42D4A8EEE5E25183.quest_subtitle: "What is this?"
	quest.42FCA469EA5C94D7.quest_desc: [
		"&#FFED54Hyperlink:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"How Artifacts Work\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4DB740093C0BA804\" } } ]"
		""
		"Default Effects"
		"&5Effect 1: Unyeilding Stance"
		"Provides +5 Armor. It also provides 25% Knockback Resistance."
		"This effect is active while the artifact is equipped and the effect is unlocked."
		""
		"Refinement Bonuses"
		"Each refinement provides an additional +0.5 Armor."
		"Each refinement also provides an additional +5% Knockback Resistance."
		"Maximum: At +10 refinement, Unyeilding Stance provides +10 Armor and 75% Knockback Resistance."
	]
	quest.42FCA469EA5C94D7.title: "&6【Artifact】&fGrade 3 Ancient Artifact"
	quest.434C555DDB10A971.quest_subtitle: "[Choose a route, you can also challenge them all alone]"
	quest.4387D3BF0F0AA32B.title: "{translate:\"task.D1E2F3A4B5C67891.title\"}"
	quest.440CA931DFF4AB39.quest_subtitle: "[Click to submit the quest after obtaining the corresponding elf]"
	quest.440CA931DFF4AB39.title: "Wind Elf•Intermediate"
	quest.4454735A12F6DC87.quest_desc: [
		"It can be found in the structure of the main world (Japanese-style buildings, master cartographer villagers have a probability of refreshing the structure map) or it can be refreshed in the wild."
		""
		"&8Neutral to all creatures unless attacked&r"
		"This is Rimuru's form during the Great Oni War, possessing the two unique Skills of Predator and Great Sage."
		""
		"&lBOSS stage explanation:&r"
		""
		"&lfirst stage&r"
		"&6-Has a 20% dodge chance of physical attacks, and will teleport to the target when dodging."
		"&6-Can swallow arrows and other projectiles."
		"&6-Skills available: water blade, ice gun, web bullets, breath (random paralysis/poison/black fire)."
		"&6-Restore 5 health points + 20 soul health points per second."
		"&6-Enter the second phase when his HP is below 50% or drops below 1000.&r"
		""
		"&lSecond stage (armored form)&r"
		"&6-When entering this stage, Rimuru will fully restore health and soul health, and clear all negative effects."
		"&6-Equip a full armored dragon suit and armored dragon gauntlet."
		"&6-Summon 4 clones to assist in the battle (the clones have 10% of the main body's EP)."
		"&6-Her passive health regeneration speed is increased to: 15 health points + 60 soul health points per second."
		"&6-In this stage, Rimuru will use all the Skills in the first stage, and additionally cast: Hellfire, Black Thunder, and Coercion."
	]
	quest.4454735A12F6DC87.quest_subtitle: "I want to challenge you"
	quest.4454735A12F6DC87.title: "Are you Rimuru?"
	quest.4488E4793D485C08.quest_subtitle: "huge \"I\""
	quest.4521C5CD54579EBA.quest_desc: ["Reset everything about you back to its initial state!"]
	quest.4521C5CD54579EBA.quest_subtitle: "Applies to “Reset Counter”."
	quest.4547F61DCD2D7B57.quest_desc: [
		"&lMy dear!&r"
		""
		""
		"&lHow to get it:&r"
		"- Abandoned mines"
		"- Fortress ruins (piglin stables)"
		"- Desert Temple"
		"-Igloo"
		"- Abandoned portal"
		"- Monster spawner"
		"- Fortress"
		"- Undersea ruins (large)"
		"- Woodland Mansion"
		"There is a 50% chance of encountering these places.&l(official data)&r"
	]
