	quest.4EDB9D7AEC78646C.quest_desc: [
		"Obtainment: Master Universal Perception + reach 10,000 maximum Magicule"
		""
		"&l[Active - Click]:&r Releases a spreading Magic Ore scan that highlights nearby Magic Ore and Deepslate Magic Ore through blocks. Before mastery, the scan has a 12-block radius, lasts 8 seconds, costs 2,500 Magicule, and has a 12-second cooldown; after mastery, its radius increases to 20 blocks, duration increases to 16 seconds, cost decreases to 1,500 Magicule, and cooldown decreases to 6 seconds. Each successful activation grants 1 Mastery Point."
	]
