	quest.69A16C2D76C41BDE.quest_desc: [
		"It likes to live in forests, plains, and swamps, so you can try your luck in those places."
		"It is a rare creature with&m&61/1000&r&r(not that low) chance of spawning instead of normal Slime."
		"[ \"It is immune to physical ranged weapons and has a very high recovery speed (it has Skill&4Super speed regeneration&r), if you are not sure enough, you may be consumed to death by it,&6Therefore, if none of your Skills can cause damage to him, you have to go to \", { \"text\": \"Elf\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4835EBAC6D933CDB\" } }, \"\"Borrow\" a few magics, this is a wise choice\" ]"
		""
