	quest.6FC262DD2B5C2847.quest_desc: [
		"&#FFED54Hyperlink:&r"
		"[ { \"text\": \"How Artifacts Work\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4DB740093C0BA804\" } } ] "
		""
		"Default Effects"
		"&5Effect 1: Silent Strike"
		"Attacking from behind, or while the target is not focused on the wearer, increases the damage of the next attack. Has a 30-second cooldown."
		"&5Effect 2: Armor Exploitation"
		"Increases critical-hit rate based on the target's Armor."
		"For every 5 Armor the target has, the wearer's critical-hit rate against that target increases."
		"&5Effect 3: Shadow Slash Mode"
		"Adds Shadow Slash Mode to Shadow Striker."
		"When used, Shadow Slash teleports the wearer behind the target they are facing and immediately attacks."
		"The attack deals critical damage with an additional Critical Damage bonus. It also applies a Resistance reduction effect on hit."
		""
		"Refinement Bonuses"
		"Silent Strike Scaling"
		"Each refinement increases Silent Strike's damage bonus by an additional 5%."
		"Maximum: At +3 refinement, Silent Strike can deal up to 65% increased damage."
		"Armor Exploitation Scaling"
		"Each refinement increases the critical-hit rate gained for every 5 Armor."
		"Maximum: At +3 refinement, Armor Exploitation can provide up to 0.5% critical-hit rate per 5 Armor."
		"Shadow Slash Mode Scaling"
		"Each refinement increases Shadow Slash Mode's Critical Damage bonus by an additional +5."
		"Maximum: At +3 refinement, Shadow Slash Mode can provide up to +50 Critical Damage."
	]
