		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Requirements to Enter the Spirit World\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"77224F3957EF8057\" } } "
	]
	quest.72C175DAC08AC81C.quest_subtitle: "How to Obtain"
	quest.73C1BBF552AF3614.quest_desc: [
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/personal_panel.png width:130 height:80 align:center}"
		""
		"&lMagicule（MP），&r"
		"Obtained by killing creatures, recovery can be achieved through natural recovery, use (various recovery potions, various silver apples), and recovery of all Magicules during resurrection."
		"Lower bound: Maximum Magicule × 1.2, recovery rate × 1.25 (+25%)"
		"End: Maximum Magicule×1.5, recovery rate×1.75 (+75%)"
		"Maze: Maximum Magicule +29,500, recovery rate ×2.0 (+100%)"
		"Hell: Maximum Magicule +100,000, recovery rate ×2.0 (+100%)"
		"Magicule can also be quickly restored in barren lands, ancient forests, miasma plains, and death deserts"
		""
		"&lEP，&r"
		"Obtained by killing creatures, the default is to obtain 3% of the EP of the killed creature each time, and allocate it to Magicule/Aura according to the identity status. EP is the identity card of this world. If there is too little, you will not be able to enter other worlds or groups."
		""
		"&lAura（AP），&r"
		"Obtained by killing creatures, all Aura can be restored through natural recovery (2 points each time) or when resurrected, which is needed to learn or use Qi Fighting Techniques"
		""
		"The abbreviation \"Human\" on the panel is a racial name"
		""
		"&lYour racial name is white on the normal identity panel."
		"&l&5If you are a demon, your race name on the panel is purple."
		"&l&4In Chaos, your race name is red on the panel."
		""
		"&6soul&rPlayers need to meet certain conditions before they can obtain it, such as obtaining&5Demon Lord Seed"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{image:ablazeaqzlcz:textures/ftb/personal_panel_2.png width:100 height:42 align:center}"
		""
		"&lMental Health (SHP),"
		"The dark orange value under the health bar is spirit, which can be increased by evolving the race. When it reaches 0, it will die directly."
		""
		"&lThe rest are the sky blue Magicule value and the orange Aura value.&r"
	]
	quest.73C1BBF552AF3614.quest_subtitle: "Key B to enter the panel (Why is there a built-in Wiki in the upper right corner?)"
